agent-plugins-example — vendored canonical Agent Plugin fixture
===============================================================

This directory is an unmodified copy of the upstream Agent Plugins reference
package, vendored as the **known-good positive fixture** in CAO's Agent Plugins
conformance corpus (design.md "Testing Strategy"; requirements.md Requirement
23.4). It is test data only: nothing here ships in the CAO wheel and nothing in
`src/` reads it.

Source project : Agent Plugins Example
Source URL     : https://github.com/agentplugins/agent-plugins-example
Source commit  : 5f3f5084a821aefa792e79500dd8f0462ab83473
Targets        : Agent Plugins specification v1.0.0
License        : MIT (see the LICENSE file in this directory)

The upstream `README.md` is not vendored — it documents the upstream repository
rather than the package contents, and the fixture only needs the plugin root
(`plugin.json` plus `skills/`). Refresh this copy by re-copying from the
upstream repository at a newer commit and updating the commit above.
